.s-xmeta { flex: 1; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-muted); }
/* Its parts as rows: the dot, the name (and MELODY), the range lined up, an arrow to the part's page. */
/* Plain rows with a hairline between (Hillel's redesign): the name with MELODY under it, the range bar on the songbook's
   one scale (Carols::SCALE, middle C a faint line), the range in words, an arrow. The whole row links its part's page. */
