   similar"): the parts two by two, each a small tile with its name (and MELODY), its range in words and its bar under the
   name; the whole tile links its part's page. */
.s-xparts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; }
.s-xpart { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(20px, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "name name" "range bar"; align-items: center; gap: 2px 10px; min-height: 44px; height: 100%; padding: 7px 10px 8px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid transparent; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-cream) 5%, var(--color-panel)); transition: opacity .2s, border-color .15s; }
.s-xpart > i, .s-xpart > svg { display: none; }
