/* A song's featured picture (site._song-picture, App\Support\Pages\SongPictures): a frame of a fixed shape (nothing
   moves as it loads), the picture cropped to it round its focus, or whole on a mat when it's far from the frame's shape. A
   song with no picture of a place or thing shows its opening words, set large in its collection's palette. Never a drawn
   person, never its music. */
.s-fpic { position: relative; display: block; overflow: hidden; margin: 0; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-cream) 7%, var(--color-panel)); }
.s-fpic img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: var(--focus, 50% 25%); }
