.s-fpic-words span { position: relative; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.3vw, 29px); line-height: 1.12; color: var(--ta); text-wrap: balance; overflow-wrap: anywhere; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 4; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; }
/* Three grounds, by the song, so a row of them never reads as one tile repeated: the palette's dark with its accent words,
