   pills; its dots, numbers, icons, rings and bars stay round (round marks, as the app's gems). The demo
   pieces are marketing's and already arcade (.s-demo, .s-cb, .s-lp, .s-ch-studio, .cp-dk-*): left alone. */
:root[data-skin='game'][data-gs] body.s-arcade:not(.s-calm) main [class*='cp-']:not([class*='cp-dk-'], [class*='-icon'], [class*='-dot'], [class*='-rec'], [class*='-ring'], [class*='-knot'], [class*='-tack'], [class*='-sign'], [class*='-win'], [class*='-bar'], [class$='-n'], [class*='-n '], [class*='-num'], :is(.s-demo, .s-cb, .s-lp, .s-ch-studio, [class*='cp-dk-']) *) { border-radius: var(--arc-radius); }
