   Whistling) square, as the arcade's cards and chips: its unit cards in the edge and hard shadow, Start here, and the
   Coming soon pill, whose rounding sits on its inner .s-soon (squaring .s-soonpill alone left it round). */
:root[data-skin='game'][data-gs] body.s-arcade:not(.s-calm) :is(.s-soonpill, .s-soonpill .s-soon, .s-unit, .s-free) { border-radius: var(--arc-radius); }
:root[data-skin='game'][data-gs] body.s-arcade:not(.s-calm) .s-unit { border: var(--arc-edge-w) solid var(--arc-line); box-shadow: var(--arc-shadow); }
:root[data-skin='game'][data-gs] body.s-arcade:not(.s-calm) .cp-vi-frame { rx: 0; } /* vibrato's picture: its rounding is the SVG's own clip */
/* The comparisons (site/compare-page.blade.php) and a song's page (public/song.blade.php) on the arcade screen: the
   two cards in the edge and hard shadow, as the course units; Stackapella's cells in the table, the song's chips and its
   parts' ranges square (a range a power bar, not a pill). The parts' letter discs are coins and stay round. */
:root[data-skin='game'][data-gs] body.s-arcade:not(.s-calm) :is(.cmp-card, .cmp-table td, .s-meta > span, .s-range-row, .s-range-track, .s-range-bar) { border-radius: var(--arc-radius); }
:root[data-skin='game'][data-gs] body.s-arcade:not(.s-calm) .cmp-card { border: var(--arc-edge-w) solid var(--arc-line); box-shadow: var(--arc-shadow); }
:root[data-skin='game'][data-gs] body.s-arcade:not(.s-calm) .cp-vi-pool svg { border-radius: var(--arc-radius); }
/* About, the "for" pages, the guides' list and What's new on the arcade screen (game's next pass, 2026-11-10): Hillel's
   letter and the maker's videos framed like the stage card, a video's play button and length square like the landing's
